---
import { ArrowUpRight, Sparkles } from '@lucide/astro';
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro';
---

<section id="about" class="section container" tabindex="-1" aria-label="About me">
  <SectionHeading number="01" eyebrow="A little context" title="Building beyond the surface." />
  <div class="about-grid">
    <div class="about-lead">
      <p>
        Backend is where
        <br />I put the pieces together.
      </p>
      <a href="#education" class="text-link">
        Software Engineering at KPI <ArrowUpRight size={16} aria-hidden="true" />
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="about-copy">
      <p>
        I’m a 3rd-year Software Engineering student at{' '}
        <strong>Igor Sikorsky Kyiv Polytechnic Institute</strong>, focused on Python backend
        development. My hands-on experience comes from personal and university projects, and I’m
        looking for my first commercial opportunity as a Junior / Trainee developer.
      </p>
      <p>
        I work with Django, REST APIs, PostgreSQL and asynchronous Python. Alongside backend work, I
        build bots, automate browser workflows and create frontend interfaces that connect to APIs.
      </p>
      <p>
        I like understanding how a system fits together: its data, networking, integrations and
        architecture, beyond individual lines of code.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <aside class="ai-note">
    <Sparkles size={19} aria-hidden="true" />
    <div>
      <h3>Modern tools. Accountable development.</h3>
      <p>
        I use AI tools to analyze tasks, research solutions, debug, refactor, generate code, explore
        unfamiliar technologies and review ideas. I review, understand, test and modify generated
        code before using it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </aside>
</section>
